DISCLAIMER

This dataset is factual pricing information collected from brokers' published
fee schedules. It is not investment advice and is provided "as is", without
warranty of any kind. Fees change frequently — always check the verification
date in the data and confirm against the broker's own current pricing page
before relying on any figure. Investing involves risk of loss.
